  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="25405c41-4d11-5252-af3c-7d17c3ac0105" activityNameId="635d6006-7905-5598-bee6-46f874392d47" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Lime, hydraulic, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Lime, hydraulic, at plant
Contrary to clinker production, in this module no waste materials as fuel or secondary raw materials are included. Accordingly, no CO2-emissions from burning of waste are included. Other air emissions, assumed proportional to the fuel use, are estimated to be 88% of the emissions from the clinker calcination process, because the energy consumption is assumed to be 88% of the uses for clinker making. ;
Synonyms: Klinker, Drehrohrofen, Zement, clinker, rotary kiln, cement; 
UUID: ec899361-d3ca-33a7-a607-626c0a054295
Includes the whole manufacturing process to burn hydraulic lime (raw material provision, grinding and mixing; rotary kiln process), internal processes (transport, etc.). For the infrastructure only the rotary kiln is taken into account (as material consumption). No administration is included.
Location: For some exchanges RER-modules have been used as proxy
Technology: Copy of the clinker production technology with mainly adjustments of the energy amount and the emissions. Additionally some water for the hydration has been included. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 22952 t/a
Sampling: Data adapted from module "clinker, at plant" based on literature 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ec899361-d3ca-33a7-a607-626c0a054295.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
